  "order": 29,
  "track": "power",
  "useBaseCables": false,
  "lesson": "Maintenance often relocates PSUs to spare PDU outlets. Power path and data path are independent \u2014 bring the gear up on OUT5/OUT6, then the LAN ping returns.",
